  "_comment": [
    "The Fissure (Managers/Events/Fissure.cs, docs/stasis-gameplay-spec.md §12): expeditions of waves,",
    "one fight per wave, each stronger. «.fissure surface|profondeur|abime» buys the key of the band",
    "(kamas stand for the spec's Orbes) and plants the first wave on «arenaMap»; winning plants the next.",
    "Wave n's monsters are brought to baseLevel + (n-1) * levelPerWave (capped at maxLevel) with",
    "Dreams.ScaleTo, and number baseMonsters + (n-1) / wavesPerExtraMonster (at most 8). «validate»:",
    "waves needed for the expedition to count as validated (its bonus tokens); «limit»: the most waves",
    "one key gives (0 = none). Formation bonus by the number of fighters (1 to 4), from the spec.",
    "Every wave won adds to the character's cumulative count; a Dofus is guaranteed every",
    "«dofus.wavesNeeded» ELIGIBLE waves (spec: waves >= 5 in Abîme; set eligibleBands/eligibleFromWave",
    "to change it), claimed with «.fissure dofus <nom>»."
